 ##
 # ButtonHoldMs = 70
 
+##
+## Motion gating for the button bit (in millimeters). A press is only confirmed if, during
+## the whole hold time, no contact moved this far from where it was when the bit was set
+## (a contact appearing or disappearing counts as motion). Once pressed, the button is
+## released and suppressed until the bit clears if 2 or more contacts move this far
+## (scrolling). One moving contact keeps the button held (click and drag).
+## 0 disables the gating. (Default 1.5)
+##
+# ButtonMaxMoveMm = 1.5
+
 [Contacts]
 ##
 ## How the neutral value of the heatmap will be determined.
